WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.934 --> 00:00:18.421
Brad: Is everything okay, Tina?

2
00:00:18.422 --> 00:00:21.985
Tina: Everything's fine. I made it, no problem.

3
00:00:21.986 --> 00:00:23.869
Where are the batteries?

4
00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:26.112
Bello: They are in a flashlight.

5
00:00:26.113 --> 00:00:37.588
Danny: The paper clip is up there too.

6
00:00:37.589 --> 00:00:45.941
Tina: Okay, now where will I find the paper clip that Brad and Danny shrank?

7
00:00:45.942 --> 00:00:52.400
Tina: Here it is.

8
00:00:52.401 --> 00:00:54.370
Tina: I've got them.

9
00:00:54.371 --> 00:00:55.933
Bello: Good work.

10
00:00:55.934 --> 00:00:59.931
Danny: Way to go, Tina!

11
00:00:59.932 --> 00:01:02.259
Chuck: Now she needs to get down.

12
00:01:02.260 --> 00:01:04.414
Brad: How is she going to do that?

13
00:01:04.415 --> 00:01:06.666
Tina: Just a minute.

14
00:01:06.667 --> 00:01:11.585
Dave: Where'd she go?

15
00:01:11.586 --> 00:01:16.679
Tina: Watch out below!

16
00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:18.910
Danny: You could have warned us, Tina!

17
00:01:18.911 --> 00:01:20.872
Tina: I said, "Watch out."

18
00:01:20.873 --> 00:01:23.516
Okay, I'm coming down now.

19
00:01:23.517 --> 00:01:25.962
Bello: How are you going to do that?

20
00:01:25.963 --> 00:01:35.482
Tina: I'm going to jump.

21
00:01:35.483 --> 00:01:38.851
Chuck: Wow, that was a big jump.

22
00:01:38.852 --> 00:01:41.131
Dave: That was amazing!

23
00:01:41.132 --> 00:01:43.855
Danny: That's Tina!

24
00:01:43.856 --> 00:01:45.542
Tina: Here's the paper clip.

25
00:01:45.543 --> 00:01:49.031
Brad: Thanks. Okay, now the batteries.

26
00:01:49.032 --> 00:01:52.596
Tina: Just a second.

27
00:01:52.597 --> 00:01:57.185
Brad: Thanks.

28
00:01:57.186 --> 00:01:58.976
Brad: There, it's fixed.

29
00:01:58.977 --> 00:02:01.934
Chuck: Do you think it will work properly this time?

30
00:02:01.935 --> 00:02:06.046
Tina: Yeah, that little shrink-gun has caused a lot of trouble.

31
00:02:06.047 --> 00:02:08.368
Brad: I'm sure it will work.

32
00:02:08.369 --> 00:02:10.595
Danny: Hey, wait a minute.

33
00:02:10.596 --> 00:02:16.007
Danny: Brad, you said that you needed these two guys for something [n3@before you could make us big again.

34
00:02:16.008 --> 00:02:18.921
Danny: Aren't you going to do anything with them?

35
00:02:18.922 --> 00:02:22.171
Dave: What do you mean, "do something" with us?

36
00:02:22.172 --> 00:02:26.845
Brad: Don't worry. I just said that so that you would help me find them.

37
00:02:26.846 --> 00:02:29.193
Brad: I didn't know what else to do.

38
00:02:29.194 --> 00:02:31.063
Bello: You know what, Danny?

39
00:02:31.064 --> 00:02:33.123
We did need their help.

40
00:02:33.124 --> 00:02:37.018
Bello: These two rescued you and Brad from the spider web.

41
00:02:37.019 --> 00:02:40.700
Tina: And they are the ones who helped us escape from my neighbor.

42
00:02:40.701 --> 00:02:42.455
Danny: I guess you're right.

43
00:02:42.456 --> 00:02:49.772
Danny: Without all of us working together, we wouldn't be here now─[n3@and the shrink-gun wouldn't be fixed.

44
00:02:49.773 --> 00:03:04.004
Chuck: Speaking of the shrink-gun, I think it's time to try it.

45
00:03:04.005 --> 00:03:05.571
Danny: I think you're right.

46
00:03:05.572 --> 00:03:07.304
Let's give it a try.

47
00:03:07.305 --> 00:03:11.135
Brad: Okay, Danny. You go stand over there.

48
00:03:11.136 --> 00:03:13.649
Danny: Okay, I'm ready.

49
00:03:13.650 --> 00:03:27.957
Brad: One, two, three . . .

50
00:03:27.958 --> 00:03:30.255
Tina: Brad, are you all right?

51
00:03:30.256 --> 00:03:31.846
Dave: What happened?

52
00:03:31.847 --> 00:03:34.157
Brad: Did it work?

53
00:03:34.158 --> 00:03:38.408
Everyone: Oh no!
